# managed by cli-tools/dev2/dev2-edge
# certbot (pit.world), pit-proxy-cert (<name>.pit.world) and moshpit-renew (Moshpit
# names) write here; Caddy picks the new certificate up within a second or two.
[Unit]
Description=Watch dev2's certificate directories for Caddy

[Path]
PathChanged=/etc/nginx/pit-proxy-certs
PathChanged=/etc/ssl/moshpit
PathChanged=/etc/ssl/moshpit-riotcoder
PathChanged=/etc/letsencrypt/live/pit.world
Unit=caddy-edge-certs.service

[Install]
WantedBy=paths.target
